          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">What is the optimal regular expression strategy for AWS ALB access logs?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Pre-compile regular expressions using deterministic finite automaton (DFA) engines, or utilize structured space-delimited string tokenizers rather than complex backtracking regexes.</p>
